---
import universityImage from '@/assets/university-building.jpg';
import universityImageWebp from '@/assets/university-building.webp';
---

<section class="section-content">
  <h2 class="section-title">Why begin EB-5 before graduation?</h2>

  <p class="section-text">
    Starting EB-5 before graduation gives you time to document <a href="/research/ways-to-fund-eb5-investment-2026" class="text-primary hover:underline">source of funds</a>, select a project, and file before F-1 or OPT ends.
  </p>

  <p class="section-text">
    Waiting until after graduation reduces your planning time. Employment-based green card categories can take many years. EB-5 gives another option.
  </p>

  <ul class="section-text list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
    <li>Concurrent filing</li>
    <li>Adjustment of status</li>
    <li>Work authorization</li>
    <li>The difference between rural and high-unemployment EB-5 opportunities</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="section-text">
    StudentEB5 explains each step with research from immigration attorneys, regional centers, USCIS guidance, and published sources. See our guide to <a href="/research/j1-f1-h1b-eb5-concurrent-filing" class="text-primary hover:underline">EB-5 concurrent filing for students and H-1B holders</a>.
  </p>

  <picture>
    <source srcset={universityImageWebp.src} type="image/webp" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 637px" />
    <source srcset={universityImage.src} type="image/jpeg" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 637px" />
    <img
      src={universityImage.src}
      alt="Gothic university chapel with wildflower meadow representing academic excellence and growth"
      class="section-image"
      loading="lazy"
      width={637}
      height={425}
      decoding="async"
      fetchpriority="low"
    />
  </picture>
</section>
